      "body": "{\"v\":1,\"question\":\"Is Ethereum mainnet transaction 0xec2a0db25bf7a6ad6453e4061f1a1e043f12f88bd0cbca894f94995c32fa76ed, included in block 26142390 (hex 0x18ee6b6), a successful transaction sent from address 0x047f606fd5b2baa5f5c6c4ab8958e45cb6b054b7 directly to address 0x3d3c0df7c1a17d384545e9d7c8228897bd9625cb (the transaction's own from and to fields, status 1) that transferred a non-zero amount of ETH?\",\"chainId\":1,\"window\":{\"fromBlock\":26142390,\"toBlock\":26142390},\"answerType\":\"bool\",\"evidence\":\"panel\",\"panelSize\":11,\"quorum\":7,\"validForSeconds\":2592000,\"definitions\":{\"method\":\"Read eth_getTransactionByHash and eth_getTransactionReceipt for the hash from an Ethereum mainnet JSON-RPC endpoint and cite the endpoint URL and the calls as the source. A null result is not evidence: some endpoints (rpc.flashbots.net, cloudflare-eth.com) return null for this mined transaction; read it on another endpoint, e.g. https://rpc.mevblocker.io or https://ethereum-rpc.publicnode.com. Explorer labels, token names and internal transfers are not evidence.\",\"true\":\"true only if an endpoint returns the transaction with blockNumber 0x18ee6b6 and blockHash 0x7166d9dba8cff98bf47797006fcc4aac04bb3a4fdf4b53d91a1bc46a28c5cacd (the window's toBlockHash), from 0x047f606fd5b2baa5f5c6c4ab8958e45cb6b054b7, to 0x3d3c0df7c1a17d384545e9d7c8228897bd9625cb (compare lowercase strings), value greater than 0x0, and a receipt with status 0x1.\",\"false\":\"false only if an endpoint returns this transaction and it fails the true rule: another block, from or to address, a value of 0, receipt status 0, or ETH that reached the recipient only through an internal call. If no endpoint returns the transaction, write no answer and say so; never answer false for a hash you could not read.\",\"window\":\"The window is the block that holds the transaction. It fixes which chain state to read; it is not a time range to search.\"}}",
